{"type":"message","id":"06b44cb6","parentId":"75fd0842","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:45:03.216Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Thursday, May 28th, 2026 - 8:45 AM (UTC)\nReference UTC: 2026-05-28 08:45 UTC"}],"timestamp":1779957903193}}
